Derived components, with their upstream sources:

  lib/src/detection.dart
      packages/cc_domain/lib/features/meetings/domain/services/
      meeting_detection.dart
      (signal kinds and weights, corroboration fusion rule, detection policy,
       debounced prompt state machine)

  lib/src/conferencing_apps.dart
      packages/cc_domain/lib/features/meetings/domain/services/
      conferencing_apps.dart
      (catalog entries, per-meeting versus persistent distinction, matchers)

  lib/src/signal_collector.dart
      packages/cc_domain/lib/features/meetings/domain/services/
      meeting_signal_collector.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/meetings/process_meeting_signal_collector.dart
      (collector contract, error-swallowing compositor, process scan and
       per-application deduplication)

  lib/src/mic_health.dart
      packages/cc_domain/lib/features/meetings/domain/services/
      meeting_mic_health.dart
      (dead-microphone heuristic, amplitude floors, confirm and recency
       windows, level smoothing)

  lib/src/lifecycle.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/meetings/meeting_recording_session.dart
      packages/cc_infra/lib/src/meetings/meeting_summary_reconciler.dart
      (lifecycle statuses, single-finalizer rule, startup sweep recovery)

  lib/src/outcome.dart
      packages/cc_domain/lib/features/meetings/domain/services/
      meeting_outcome.dart
      (output schema, strict and lenient parsers, defensive speaker-name map)

  lib/src/speaker_labels.dart
      packages/cc_domain/lib/features/meetings/domain/services/
      meeting_diarization.dart
      (maximum-overlap speaker assignment, Person N scheme, turn merging with
       window-boundary deduplication, token containment)

Portions of the accompanying tests are likewise derived from the corresponding
Control Center test suites.
